 "silent_error": "hmmsearch computes the sequence E-value as P-value times the number of target sequences it was given (Z). Each chunk holds only 10 proteins, so every E-value is 12 times too small for the intended 120-protein search and weakly matching proteins pass the 1e-5 cutoff that should have excluded them. Nothing indicates that Z is the chunk size rather than the full database: the tblout is valid and the loop exits 0. -Z 120 (HMMER user guide) fixes the search-space size.",
